repository-code: "https://github.com/dimhold/silent-books"
abstract: "A model is asked to summarise a profit and loss account carrying one misstated subtotal. Asked only to summarise, haiku-4-5 and sonnet-5 miss it 20 of 20 and repeat the wrong figure as fact; one added clause takes both to 10 of 10. opus-5 and fable-5 catch it unprompted. 80 clean reports, zero false alarms."
keywords:
  - "LLM evaluation"
  - "financial statement verification"
  - "silent failures"
  - "prompt sensitivity"
  - "error injection"
